Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.32,Short,,0,0,0,,You hear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:00.96,Short,,0,0,0,,a song
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:01.74,Short,,0,0,0,,or a cold
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:02.62,Short,,0,0,0,,wind hits you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.62,0:00:03.66,Short,,0,0,0,,and suddenly every
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:04.16,Short,,0,0,0,,hair on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.16,0:00:05.06,Short,,0,0,0,,your arms stands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.06,0:00:06.22,Short,,0,0,0,,straight up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:06.92,Short,,0,0,0,,You see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:07.58,Short,,0,0,0,,each hair has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.58,0:00:08.42,Short,,0,0,0,,a tiny muscle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:09.56,Short,,0,0,0,,attached to it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.56,0:00:09.82,Short,,0,0,0,,and when
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:10.70,Short,,0,0,0,,your brain feels
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:11.26,Short,,0,0,0,,a jolt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:12.28,Short,,0,0,0,,of cold
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:12.80,Short,,0,0,0,,fear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.62,Short,,0,0,0,,or emotion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:14.52,Short,,0,0,0,,it squeezes all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:14.76,Short,,0,0,0,,of them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:15.44,Short,,0,0,0,,at once
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:16.18,Short,,0,0,0,,pulling your skin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:17.26,Short,,0,0,0,,into bumps
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.26,0:00:17.70,Short,,0,0,0,,For our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:18.94,Short,,0,0,0,,furry ancestors
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:19.62,Short,,0,0,0,,this fluffed up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:20.12,Short,,0,0,0,,their fur
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.02,Short,,0,0,0,,to trap warm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:21.80,Short,,0,0,0,,air and make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.80,0:00:22.82,Short,,0,0,0,,them look bigger
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:23.26,Short,,0,0,0,,just like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.26,0:00:24.58,Short,,0,0,0,,a scared cat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:25.14,Short,,0,0,0,,But since we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:25.70,Short,,0,0,0,,lost most
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:26.52,Short,,0,0,0,,of our fur
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.52,0:00:27.14,Short,,0,0,0,,it barely does
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:28.16,Short,,0,0,0,,anything for us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:29.18,Short,,0,0,0,,And they're called
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.18,0:00:30.14,Short,,0,0,0,,goosebumps because
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.14,0:00:31.10,Short,,0,0,0,,your skin ends
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.10,0:00:31.74,Short,,0,0,0,,up looking like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.74,0:00:32.80,Short,,0,0,0,,a plucked goose
